    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if You could control gravity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is actually easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just need to go to space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, take control and simulate gravity using thrusters, centrifugal force and more in this 2D physics platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about Newtonian physics, Galilean Relativity in a fun environment with a cute cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivering educational content with neat game mechanics have been a dream for me for a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join me in my search for knowledge in the vast expanses of space and explore the mysteries of the physics in zero gravity and many more gravities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Space, no-one can hear you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplatform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touchscreen compatible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic introduction to physics for young and old</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if You could control gravity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is actually easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just need to go to space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, take control and simulate gravity using thrusters, centrifugal force and more in this 2D physics platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about Newtonian physics, Galilean Relativity in a fun environment with a cute cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivering educational content with neat game mechanics have been a dream for me for a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join me in my search for knowledge in the vast expanses of space and explore the mysteries of the physics in zero gravity and many more gravities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Space, no-one can hear you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplatform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touchscreen compatible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic introduction to physics for young and old</p></li></ul>",
